~ start
The old machine hums awake.[wait=0.3] The glass is cracked, but the lights still blink.
=> shop

~ shop
SELECT AN ITEM.
- {{get_listing(0)}} [if not is_sold_out(0)]
	=> buy_0
- {{get_listing(1)}} [if not is_sold_out(1)]
	=> buy_1
- {{get_listing(2)}} [if not is_sold_out(2)]
	=> buy_2
- {{get_listing(3)}} [if not is_sold_out(3)]
	=> buy_3
- {{get_listing(4)}} [if not is_sold_out(4)]
	=> buy_4
- Walk away.
	=> END

~ buy_0
if buy(0)
	Clunk.[wait=0.3] Something drops into the tray.
elif not can_fit(0)
	The tray is jammed.[wait=0.3] (Your bag is full.)
else
	INSUFFICIENT FUNDS.
=> shop

